    <string name="dynsticker_exact_imported">Imported packs</string>
    <string name="dynsticker_exact_always">Everything</string>
    <string name="dynsticker_exact_info">The exact engine draws templates made for it exactly as their makers meant. Imported packs uses it for packs from feeds and the addon store, and the keyboard’s own engine for the rest.</string>

    <string name="dynsticker_fonts_title">Fonts</string>
    <string name="dynsticker_fonts_info">The built-in templates are drawn in DynaPuff, and the memes in Anton. Both are free fonts (SIL Open Font License), downloaded once into your font library. Until then the templates use a bold font of the phone’s own.</string>
